# Data Files

The data files used in this project are confidential laboratory data from the
Lam Laboratory at the University of Delaware and are not included in this repository.

## Required Files

Place the following files in this `data/` directory to run the notebook:

| Filename | Description | Source |
|---|---|---|
| `human_mouse_mito_overlay.xlsx` | Human mitochondrial proteomics — pharmacological Hsp90β modulation | Lam Laboratory |
| `Copy of betaKO_rna_protein_mapped_aug182024.xlsx` | Mouse Hsp90β KO vs wildtype RNA-Seq | Lam Laboratory |
| `Diff_Exp_Combined_Outliers_removed.xlsx` | Alpha vs Beta KO differential expression | Lam Laboratory |
| `LamCK_062223_cyclicloess_Ttest__2_.xlsx` | Human cardiac proteomics NF vs ICM | Lam Laboratory |


## Sheets Used From Each File

### human_mouse_mito_overlay.xlsx
- `Hsp90-dependent subset` — 46 confirmed Hsp90β client proteins (positive labels)
- `treatment_groups_proteomics` — 5,876 proteins for negative example filtering

### Copy of betaKO_rna_protein_mapped_aug182024.xlsx
- `rna_WT_vs_Beta` — 14,943 genes with logFC, FDR, logCPM (Beta KO features)

### Diff_Exp_Combined_Outliers_removed.xlsx
- `Alpha_vs_Beta` — 14,921 genes with logFC, FDR (isoform specificity features)

### LamCK_062223_cyclicloess_Ttest__2_.xlsx
- `cyclic_loess_data` — 96 human cardiac proteins (disease validation only)
